# Calving Front: Cold Storage, track 2 (SPEC 19.8). Under the glacier face:
# along the foot of the ice cliff, where blocks calve off and slide across
# the road (two movers on the face's timer, drawn as ice pinnacles), a
# jump across a crevasse on the east run, a meltwater channel (slick) at
# the bottom, up a long sweep of glare ice the glacier's melt has
# polished, round the serac field, and over the west crevasse and its
# channel to the line.
name CALVING FRONT
order 2
floor snow
background glacier
league cold_storage
width 52
# x    y    half   features
 260  150   56     sweeper,period=780,speed=40,size=16,phase=0     # start line, heading east; a block calves off the face
 500  140   56     sweeper,period=780,speed=40,size=16,phase=390   # and another
 740  150   56
 880  230   52
 905  380   50     ramp            # the east crevasse: jump it
 905  600   50
 880  790   52     coolant         # a meltwater channel
 740  890   54     crates
 600  840   50     drift,p=100     # up the polished glare ice
 560  680   48     drift,p=100
 540  480   48
 450  340   48
 330  390   48
 300  560   50
 330  730   50     crates
 240  880   52
 120  820   52
 110  640   50     ramp            # the west crevasse
 110  420   50     coolant         # its meltwater
 150  250   54
# Props: seracs at the foot of the face, radar and turbines on the
# moraine, the colony sign by the serac field.
props pinnacle seg 0 side left gap 60 off 24
props pinnacle seg 2 side left gap 60 off 24
props turbine,radar seg 5 side right gap 90 off 26
props pinnacle,crane seg 8 side right gap 80 off 24
props pinnacle seg 12 side right gap 70 off 22
props turbine seg 16 side left gap 90 off 26
prop sign 430 560
prop penguin 446 640
